paperwallet-tools for Debian
----------------------------

The programs are installed as /usr/bin/paperwallet and /usr/bin/paperseed:
where README.md says ./paperwallet.py or ./paperseed.py, use those commands.
The code lives in /usr/share/paperwallet-tools.

Generate wallets on a machine disconnected from the network, and keep the
PDF and .md files they write private: they contain the secrets.

